# Witness for EntryCheckMeetsRoutingAdmission. The edge's check is replaced by FALSE, so the
# invariant fails exactly when a kept step of its kind - a straddler - is
# reachable under every guarantee. A clean base run with this mutant red
# shows the edge was checked on real steps, not vacuously.
MODULE: EntryCheckMeetsRoutingAdmissionWitness
TARGET: EntryCheckMeetsRoutingAdmission
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a straddler is reachable: the edge's check is not vacuous

--- FIND
Fails("EntryCheckMeetsRoutingAdmission", RAllocGuard("S", memFence, [i \in Inits |-> s]))
--- REPLACE
Fails("EntryCheckMeetsRoutingAdmission", FALSE)
--- END
